# Loragent naming convention

All Lorapok portable agent artifacts **must** start with `loragent-`:

- Skills: `loragent-{topic}/SKILL.md`
- Rules: `loragent-{topic}.mdc`
- Subagents: `loragent-{role}.md`
- Agents: `loragent-{orchestrator}.md`
- MCP server id: `loragent`

## Project root

`<PROJECT_ROOT>`

## Install

Run `~/.local/bin/sync-global-agent-stack` or `scripts/sync-loragent-stack.sh`.

## Docs

- `docs/INSTALL.md` — symlink skills/rules globally
- `docs/HOW-TO-USE.md` — workflows and MCP stack

## Deployment

Production deploys for Lorapok products go through Mission Control only (see `loragent-deployment.mdc`).
